<title>USA: TABLE - Farm Family Q2 oper net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Farm Family Q2 oper net rises.</headline>
<dateline>GLENMONT, N.Y. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.37		    $0.84</p>
<p> Net		 7,220		    1,637</p>
<p> Revs		46,087		   36,106</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  5,254		    3,000</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.96		    $0.65</p>
<p> Net		 10,276		   1,939</p>
<p> Revs		85,606		   71,916</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  5,254		    3,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Number of shares reflects allocation of 3 million shares in conversion from mutual company.</p>
<p>Operating income for Q2 1997 was $3.6 million or $0.69 per share vs $2.5 million or $0.84. Per share decline reflects additional shares from IPO. Operating income for six-month 1997 was $1.28 vs $1.10. Q2 1997 net includes realized investment gain of $5.6 million. Q2 1996 net includes $896,000 charge from conversion from mutual company.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Farm Family Holdings Inc.</p>
